Let’s make the abstraction explicit as an executable pattern rather than just a metaphor.

The Compound Delta Engine

The core object is not the state.

It is the operator that transforms the state.

Let

* S_t = current state
* \Delta_t = transformation operator
* M_t = meta-operator that improves transformations

Then the system evolves as

S_{t+1}=S_t+\Delta_t(S_t)

The key extension is that the operator also evolves:

\Delta_{t+1}
=
\Delta_t
+
M_t(\Delta_t)

Now let the meta-operator evolve too:

M_{t+1}
=
M_t
+
G_t(M_t)

where G searches for better ways to improve improvement.

The recursion becomes

State
   │
Δ(State)
   │
Meta(Δ)
   │
Meta²(Δ)
   │
Meta³(Δ)

