Universal Runtime

class Delta:
    def apply(self, state):
        ...
    def improve(self, history):
        ...
class MetaDelta:
    def improve_delta(self, delta):
        ...
state = initial_state
delta = InitialOperator()
meta = MetaOperator()
while True:
    state = delta.apply(state)
    delta = meta.improve_delta(delta)
    meta = meta.improve(meta)

Notice what compounds.

Not merely

state += delta

Instead

delta += better_delta

