Attention as a Delta Search

A conceptual approximation of what happens during inference is:

possible = retrieve_nearby_concepts(input)
for candidate in possible:
    score = (
        context(candidate)
        + narrative(candidate)
        + coherence(candidate)
        + history(candidate)
    )
return max(score)

Every layer repeats

representation += useful_delta

until convergence.

